 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-m20-2",
  "date": "2026-11-05",
  "draft_py": "# Winged Words: Sanguine Indulgence's self CostModifier (\"This spell costs {3} less to cast if ...\")\n# with {1} and Celestial Enforcer's condition \"if you control a creature with flying\". The\n# compiler's \"Draw two cards.\" spell is kept, after it.\nreduce = CostModifier(\n    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n    controller_ref=ControllerRef.YOU,\n    delta=CostDeltaReduceGeneric(amount=QConst(value=1)),\n    condition=FAtom(\n        pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_COUNT_GE,\n        count=QConst(value=1),\n        inner_filter=FAnd(children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.KEYWORD_HAS, keyword=Keyword.FLYING),\n        )),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [reduce, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a creature with flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Draw two cards.",
    "ir": "abilities[1].effect"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "The probe board gives you no flier, so the reduction is not exercised there. Packs winged_words/pack_reduced.json (cast with {U}{U} while you control a flier) and pack_not_reduced.json (only the opponent has a flier: not castable with {U}{U}) pass."
 },
